flowchart TD
  start[User opens a feature] --> policy[Load exported or local capability policy]
  policy --> provider[Select providers by surface capability]
  provider --> fanout[Query independent public providers]
  fanout --> claims[Retain result, provider, operator, timestamp, and error]
  claims --> verify{Can the result be cryptographically verified?}
  verify -->|No| unverified[Mark unverified; do not promote to authority]
  verify -->|Yes| compare[Compare usable claims and stale or partial results]
  compare --> reconcile{User-owned reconciliation policy}
  reconcile -->|agreement| result[Render attributable result]
  reconcile -->|disagreement| disclose[Show disagreement and preserve alternatives]
  reconcile -->|unavailable| fallback[Use explicit fallback or fail closed]
  unverified --> result
  disclose --> result
  fallback --> result

  result --> write{Does the action need a write grant?}
  write -->|No| done[Complete read-only action]
  write -->|Yes| grant[Compute missing feature-scoped OAuth permissions]
  grant --> granted{Grant present?}
  granted -->|Yes| execute[Use the existing DPoP-bound session]
  granted -->|No| reauth[Request explicit reauthorization with current plus missing scopes]
  reauth --> execute
  execute --> done

  done --> export[Export or reset portable provider and policy state]
  export --> custody{Does identity recovery need a user-held key?}
  custody -->|No| end[Record evidence and exit]
  custody -->|Yes| prepare[Prepare non-exportable or explicitly backed-up rotation key]
  prepare --> authority[Require current protocol authority and verify the signed operation]
  authority -->|unsupported or rejected| end
  authority -->|accepted| end
